              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sarmatian noble cavalry have hand weapon, heavy armour and kontos. May have composite bow (+4) and barding (+2). Can only be used if there are at least two units of Horse Archers and there must be fewer Noble models than there are Horse Archer models.</characteristic>
