                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Driver has heavy armour and improvised weapon. Scythed chariots may be fielded in units of 1 or more models. Each model has a unit strength of 3. May not take leaders, standards or musicians. Heavy Chariot causing D6+2 impact hits.</characteristic>
