              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Phalanx has hand weapon, shield and pike. May have light armour (+2). Trained Phalanx. At least on phalanx unit must be fielded. Late in the period phalanx infantry may instead be fielded with large shield and heavy throwing spear, and are no longer Trained Phalanx (-1). If this option is taken Levy Phalanx should not be used.</characteristic>
